<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aukland half yr shr jumps, no div.</title>
<headline>Aukland half yr shr jumps, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     16.5	  vs 9.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 none	  vs none</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.48	  vs 1.40</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.96	  vs 2.12</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.02	  vs 0.72</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   1.70	  vs 0.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		  81.71	 vs 20.26</p>
<p>Full name: Aukland Investments Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they expect to improve on results in the second six months of the financial year with a large number of orders for hospital equipment to be completed then. A satisfactory number of new orders have already been secured.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
